# Phase 02 Input Artifacts

Committed synthetic parse-artifact fixture directories for the deterministic tree pipeline.

These fixtures are curated for small, deterministic Phase 02 edge cases. They are not guaranteed
to be byte-for-byte faithful snapshots of Phase 01 persistence behavior.

In particular:

- fixture directories may include extra `native.rawdict` artifacts even when Phase 01 selective
  sampling would not have persisted them for the same page indices
- the tree pipeline should treat these as valid synthetic inputs for hierarchy testing, not as
  strict parser-regression fixtures
